              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(56,189,248,0.08); color: #38BDF8;">Calc表計算</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(56,189,248,0.08); color: #38BDF8;">Impressプレゼン</span>
