                  <span class="font-bold font-mono text-base" style="color: #4ADE80;">ap-audio</span>
                  <span class="text-xs font-bold font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded" style="color: #4ADE80; background: rgba(74,222,128,0.08);">141 ✓</span>
