              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(74,222,128,0.08); color: #4ADE80;">マルチトラックミックス</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(74,222,128,0.08); color: #4ADE80;">音声分析</span>
