              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">コース録音</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">会議音声</span>
